<p class="games-lead">Little games played in the page, each one a tag of its own - a file of
<code>pad/subs/games/types/</code> in the engine, written <code>{pad:open/}game:name/{pad:close/}</code>, as
<code>{pad:open/}game:name/{pad:close/}</code>. The server writes
the board, a script in the page plays it.</p>

<h2>Games</h2>
<ul class="games-cards">
  {array:games}
  <li><a class="games-card" href="?{$game}"><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{pad:open/}{$game}/{pad:close/}</code></a></li>
  {/array:games}
</ul>

<h2>Toys and simulations</h2>
<p class="games-lead">Explore live simulations and visual experiments alongside the games.</p>
<ul class="toys-cards">
  {array:toys}
  <li><a class="toys-card" href="?toys/{$toy}"><b>{$name}</b><span>{$line}</span><code>{pad:open/}toy:{$toy}/{pad:close/}</code></a></li>
  {/array:toys}
</ul>

{common:showcaseExamples/}
